cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Proxy IP Pricing in China (2026): 24 Providers — Prices, Protocols, Coverage and Official Registration Links"
abstract: >-
  An open dataset of proxy IP pricing in the Chinese market (2026), covering 24 providers:
  entry price and normalised lowest month-card price, geographic coverage, supported protocols
  (SOCKS5 / HTTP / L2TP / PPTP), free-trial availability, and official registration links.
  Released under CC0-1.0 and refreshed monthly.
type: dataset
authors:
